FIND  -FIND Control
> _ff  FIND FILE 
   _ff  [N]  pattern
   _ff  PATH  pattern
 ex.
   _ff 1 *.ts
   _ff ~/solidjs-dnd-resize  *.ts

> _fd  FIND DRECTORY
   _fd  [N]  pattern
   _fd  PATH  pattern
 ex.
   _fd 1 src
   _fd ~/solidjs-dnd-resize  src

>  _fs       find current dir save
>  _fd [N]   find dir stack delete
>  _fp       find dir stack print
>  _fe       find dir stack edit
>  _fr       find dir stack reset
>  _fh       find help
>  _fa       find alias

